  m_Name: Files 19 - Disable Meshes Normals
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data:
    name: Disable Meshes Normals
    description: "<b>\u2022 What It Does:</b> Controls whether normals are included
      in the mesh\u2019s vertex data. Normals are mainly used for lighting calculations
      like diffuse and specular shading.\n\n<b>\u2022 Our Modification:</b> We disable
      normals for meshes that don\u2019t require dynamic lighting, reducing vertex
      data size and improving GPU efficiency on mobile VR."
